```Motivated by S17: hxxps://www[.]hotmail[.]com-...@dt3-...run[.]app (real host sits after the @)```
```Source: Splunk, email gateway or proxy logs with a url field```
index=email OR index=proxy
| regex url="^https?://[^/]*@"
| rex field=url "^https?://(?<userinfo>[^@/]*)@(?<real_host>[^/:]+)"
| table _time, sender, recipient, url, userinfo, real_host
